74 342 850 356 819 356\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#DBC9A8\" stroke-width=\".8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 12\" opacity=\".75\"/><path d=\"M902 350C874 350 850 361 819 361\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#DBC9A8\" stroke-width=\".8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 12\" opacity=\".75\"/><path d=\"M922 358C874 358 850 366 819 366\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#DBC9A8\" stroke-width=\".8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 12\" opacity=\".75\"/><path d=\"M942 366C874 366 850 371 819 371\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#DBC9A8\" stroke-width=\".8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 12\" opacity=\".75\"/><path d=\"M962 374C874 374 850 376 819 376\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#DBC9A8\" stroke-width=\".8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 12\" opacity=\".75\"/><path d=\"M902 382C874 382 850 381 819 381\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#DBC9A8\" stroke-width=\".8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 12\" opacity=\".75\"/><path d=\"M922 390C874 390 850 386 819 386\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#DBC9A8\" stroke-width=\".8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 12\" opacity=\".75\"/><path d=\"M942 398C874 398 850 391 819 391\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#DBC9A8\" stroke-width=\".8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 12\" opacity=\".75\"/><path d=\"M962 406C874 406 850 396 819 396\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#DBC9A8\" stroke-width=\".8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 12\" opacity=\".75\"/></g>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      </svg><p>点击结构编号或标签可查看对应部位。场景为教学合成示意，非现场资料。结构示意，非比例绘图。</p>"
